{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1453086-sept-populations","id":1453086,"title":"Sept Populations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-06-21T15:35:24-07:00","id":1453086,"title":"Sept Populations","content":"About how many packs are needed to maintain a Healthy Caern?<br /> This question likely also applies to Slews and Grottoes and Clutches and Wallows Etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26780-crazyjabberwock","name":"Crazyjabberwock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26780_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-21T16:25:01-07:00","id":1453089,"title":"","content":"Depends a lot of the rating of the Caern, and then a good deal on the skills of characters involved. A relatively large population of nearby kinfolk can also make up for less packs by handling a lot of steps that don't technically need a Garou to do as long as a Garou handles the &quot;big&quot; stuff. And of course, there are Garou without packs (cubs, packs that have dissolved, survivors of pack that got in over their heads, Ronin sitting on the edges doing favors for access to Caern/Sept resources, visiting Garou, etc).<br /> <br /> I'd say a good estimate to keep things how the books tend to describe them is 1-3 packs(/etc.) per rating of the Caern(/etc). The above factors influencing in either direction depending on their presence or absence.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-21T16:35:36-07:00","id":1453091,"title":"","content":"So a Place with a Rating 7 Totem might need roughly 10 packs coming and going give or take for kin and visitors?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26780-crazyjabberwock","name":"Crazyjabberwock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26780_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-21T19:30:25-07:00","id":1453103,"title":"","content":"Caern Totems don't have a rating like Pack Totems do (even if they're the same spirit). Caerns are rated 1-5 to determine how powerful they are, and thus how much power the Caern Totem spirit has, and how many Garou it takes to maintain it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-21T23:35:53-07:00","id":1453112,"title":"","content":"&quot;Guardians of the Caerns&quot; Sourcebook stated that five Guardians per Caern level are appropriate to defend a Caern. Add garou to fill all sept positions. With that you have the total number of garou in a sept. Divide that by two to get the actual number a sept has, so start shifting sept positions and duties, so that some garou might hold different offices.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}